	(text "WS2812B x36 chain (6x6 matrix): D1-D36, each DOUT -> next DIN.\nThis sheet shows D1 as a representative unit only.\nCopy D1+R1 for D2-D36 in the PCB/GUI; power (+5V/GND) can use\nindividual power symbols per LED (same-name symbols share one net).\nGPIO7 freed up (no longer used by the old 2-LED design)."
